==German==

===Etymology===
Humorous feminine form of {{term|Bulle||cop|lang=de}}, formed to sound alike to the eastern German word {{term|Bulette||meatball|lang=de}} and only common where this latter word is used.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bʊˈlɛtə/|lang=de}}
* {{homophones|lang=de|Bulette}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Bulletten}}

# {{context|regional|pejorative|lang=de}} a female [[cop]]
# {{context|regional|slang|lang=de}} a [[Berlin]] citizen

